(This description is partly based on or reuses content from the Wikipedia article \"PCMCIA\" (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PCMCIA) and is licensed under the GNU Free Documentation License (http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/fdl.html).)"""@en;
