(This description is partly based on or reuses content from the Wikipedia article \"Progressive scan\" (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressive_scan) and is licensed under the GNU Free Documentation License (http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/fdl.html).)"""@en;
                    rdfs:label "Progressive Scan"@en,
