             rdfs:subPropertyOf gr:quantitativeProductOrServiceProperty.
ceo:hasDepthWithStand ceo:belongsToModule "TV"@en;
                      a owl:ObjectProperty;
                      rdfs:comment """Defines the distance from side to side, measuring across the object with its stand at right angles to the width (Common unit of measurement centimetre, CMT).

