ceo:hasDigitalZoom ceo:belongsToModule "DigitalCamera, Camcorder"@en;
                   a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                   rdfs:comment """Zoom is a method of decreasing (narrowing) the apparent angle of view of a photographic or video image.

